      A small command-line tool used as a givn test fixture.
      
      ## Quick start
      
      ```sh
      cargo install test-project
      test-project --help
      ```
      
      ## Prerequisites
      
      Rust (latest stable).
      
      ## Usage
      
      `test-project <args>` prints the requested output to stdout.
      
      ## Contributing
      
      Conventional Commits; PRs require a green test suite.
      
      ## License
      
      MIT
      
      <!-- givn:begin:development -->
      ## Development
      
      - Verify: `./emit-result.sh regular`
      - Measure coverage: `./measure-coverage.sh`
      - Merge coverage: `cp coverage/non-e2e-cobertura.xml coverage/cobertura-coverage.xml`
      <!-- givn:end:development -->
      
